3. Reproduce cell 35 aggregation (WA-LIME)
==============================================================================
   top-10 by aggregated |weight|:
      1. time                     42.2668
      2. sensor measurement 15    16.3952
      3. sensor measurement 11    12.1127
      4. sensor measurement 4     7.7154
      5. sensor measurement 13    5.0780
      6. sensor measurement 3     2.2068
      7. sensor measurement 7     0.9601
      8. sensor measurement 2     0.7984
      9. sensor measurement 17    0.4041
     10. sensor measurement 9     0.2220
   non-zero features: 12 / 25
   sum of aggregated weights: 88.5074

   NOTE ON THE ESTIMATOR: each run contributes only its top-8 features;
   absent features are implicitly counted as 0. So agg[j] is
   mean over 5 runs of (|w_j| if j in top-8 else 0)  --  a *shrunk* mean,
   not the mean |w_j|. Features that are strong-but-inconsistent are
   penalised twice (once by truncation, once by the /5).
